          "value": "PD US Government|FEDLINK - United States Federal Collection|Academic theses and dissertations of the Naval Postgraduate School|Documents from the US Naval Postgraduate School Library|Scans from the Internet Archive/unverified|CC-PD-Mark|Scans from the Internet Archive|Books uploaded by Fæ|Books without Wikidata item",
